  "schema:comment": "MIT code + scenario specs; patient data not distributed (MIMIC-IV derivative, PhysioNet DUA). Early-stage (16 stars, no releases/paper DOI yet, 'being prepared for public release'). Judgement auto-scored by harvester. Re-verify maturity + paper on next review.",
